Fly's sky scene, the game's supply (3ds_port/src/3ds_fly_sky.c,
include/3ds_fly_sky.h): follower_mon.c holds up to eight follower sprite
files for the scene (FollowerMon_SkyFile, released by FollowerMon_SkyRelease,
also on a soft reset) and seats a rider on a frame as the Fly sprite does
(FollowerMon_SkySeat); field_effect.c tells which Pokemon does the Fly
(FieldEffect_FlyMon); event_object_movement.c gives an object event
palette by its tag (ObjectEventPaletteByTag), for the seated player.
Applies after 0085-fly-direction-and-landing.patch; apply with tools/bootstrap.py.

